!*env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519

# Local JSON databases and runtime business data
# These modules currently store HR/payroll/reimbursement/customer/vendor data locally.
# Keep real data out of GitHub; commit only schemas/docs/examples.
**/database/*.json
!**/database/*.example.json
!**/database/README.md
**/database/backups/
**/database/sessions/

# Project memory and historical archives may contain operational/private notes
memory/
**/memory/
**/archive/

